            "detailed_description": "Take action in this awesome Party Game!<br />\r\nGather your friends and loose your friendship laughing!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo play this amazing platform-shooter you must shoot pieces of you at your enemies, trying to push them out of the arena!<br />\r\nBe careful! Each piece you shoot, you loose in weight, making yourself easier to push!<br />\r\nBut you can take back your pieces, or the ones of your enemies! Awesome!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs if it wasn't enough, there are also plenty of items that can be used to help you claim victory, or just to make everything more chaotic!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt least 1 controller or another device running the game in a local network is needed to play.",
